This is the snd_framewok-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the snd_framewok blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'snd_framewok', which is imported as:

    import snd_framewok

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(snd_framewok)
